  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rosy Ranjitham vs The Deputy Director on 26 November, 2024",
    "facts": "The petitioner was arrested and remanded into judicial custody, in pursuant to the registration of the FIR in Cr.No.247 of 2024 for the offences under Sections 296(b), 132, 123, 351(3) BNS and Section 24(1) of the Cigarette and Other Tobacco Products Act, on 05.10.2024 on the allegation that the petitioner had sold the Tobacco products. 5. In pursuant to the registration of the criminal case as against the petitioner, the Designated Officer of the Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Tirunelveli passed an order on 15.10.2024, thereby, imposed a fine of Rs.25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousand only) as the first time offender under the Food Safety and Standards (Licensing and Registration of Food Businesses) Regulations, 2011.",
    "arguments": "",
